:: 3 {"position":"1375,550","size":"100,100"}

			Yes! The hunters were hunting deers!
			<div>
            	<img class="story-img" src="Canva\Start Walking 1.png">
            </div>
			The @@.orange;hunters@@ continue:
			<i>« Now… now I remember perfectly! The area was full of deers! We painted so many of them on the walls of the cave, while in the flickering firelight we recounted our feats, so that they would be passed down from generation to generation. Yes… ''Deer hunting'' was a fundamental activity for us: a ritual, a test of courage, a way to honor the Great Mother and ensure the prosperity of our group. »</i>

			After the hunters have finished telling their story, the @@.orange;Shaman@@ says:
			<i>« I am glad I brought you here. I have called you through time so that someone, in the far future, might remember the history of my people and of this place of worship.

			You paid attention to our story even before I woke up. I know that speleologists like adventures and I also know that one of your goals is to protect the past hidden in the uderground. You have helped us tell our own story and have passed all of my tests. »</i>

			@@.orange;He@@ continues:
			<i>« To show my appreciation, I would like you to put your handprints alongside the ones of our people. We will remember you the same way you will remember us. Thank you,''Dear Friends''. »</i>

			[[Add your Handprint]]

			<<audio wrongsound stop>>
			<<audio rightsound play>>
			<<audio mainsound play>>
		


