:: Ask for Hints {"position":"400,450","size":"100,100"}

			@@.orange;Speleologist 1@@ asks the Shaman:
			<i>« What do you mean when you say that the offerings are near us? »</i>

			The @@.orange;Shaman@@ replies:
			<i>« Where do you keep your tools? »</i>

			@@.orange;Speleologist 4@@ says:
			<i>« Ah! The backpack! »</i>

			[[Open your Backpack]]
		


:: Choose text 1 {"position":"1075,525","size":"100,100"}

			<div>
            	<img class="story-img" src="Canva\UI wrong choice from game 1) _ _Choose Text 1.png">
            </div>
			This choice doesn't seem to be very in line with the Shaman's story. Try to think about the context of the cave and Neolithic history, what do you think he would like to tell you?

			@@.orange;Shaman:@@
			<i>« Are you sure this is correct? Maybe you could try another time. »</i>

			Choose another option:

			<i>« … Becomes a high-quality cultural asset — ideal for enhancing the region and promoting sustainable tourism. Would you like my answer to be more detailed, more concise, or more relevant to your visit to the site? »</i>
			[[Choose text 1]]

			<i>« … Unites us to our origin, for every painting and every object here tells who we were, how we lived, and what sacred bonds connected us to the Great Mother. »</i>
			[[Choose text 2]]

			<<audio rightsound stop>>
			<<audio wrongsound play>>
			<<audio mainsound play>>
		


:: Choose text 2 {"position":"725,625","size":"100,100"}

			<div>
            	<img class="story-img" src="Canva\UI correct choice from game 1) _ _Choose Text 2.png">
            </div>
			@@.orange;Shaman:@@
			<i>« Yes! Those are the words I was looking for. And so, as I was telling you all... »</i>

			Great choice! The Shaman seems to have regained his memories and can now get back to the telling of his story!

			<i>« [...] And now I will show you what … Unites us to our origin, for every painting and every object here tells who we were, how we lived, and what sacred bonds connected us to the Great Mother. »</i>

			[[Keep Listening]]

			<<audio wrongsound stop>>
			<<audio rightsound play>>
			<<audio mainsound play>>
		


:: Continue {"position":"600,150","size":"100,100"}

			<video controls playsinline>
			<source src="assets/videos/video-ai-starting-point.mp4" type="video/mp4">
			</video>
			<div class="passage-text">
			You are a ''speleologist'', a specialist of caves and you love exploring them.
			This time you are in Otranto doing research on the land with four colleagues.<br>
			While examining the morphological characteristics, suddenly, the sky turns black and the earth starts trembling.
			A crack is forming under your feet and quickly turns into a hole...  
			There's a purple smoke coming out of it.<br>
			You and your colleagues fall into the hole and pass out.

			[[Go on]]
			</div>
		


