:: Done Exploring {"position":"1200,250","size":"100,100"}

			<div>
            	<img class="story-img" src="Canva\(Fahmy) __Done Exploring__.gif">
            </div>
			After you and your colleagues are done exploring the cave, a glow appears behind you; leaving you with no choice but to turn around and find its source. 

			You see the pictogram you interpreted as a dancing Shaman actually dancing on the wall. The air feels heavy again, the purple smoke comes back alongside some peculiar scents.

			After the disappearing smoke clears your vision; you see a fire pit below the wall and it seems like there is someone now, in front of it, mumbling something.

			@@.orange;Speleologist 4:@@
			<i>« Oh no! Someone really did appear! I was joking when I said that! »</i>

			You and your colleagues are scared but decide to get closer.

			[[Get Closer]]
			
			<<audio dancingshamansound play>>
			
			<<audio mainsound play>>
			
		


:: Done Placing {"position":"750,825","size":"100,100"}

			<div>
            	<img class="story-img" src="Canva\Start Walking 1.png">
            </div>
			The fire gets stronger and the Shaman invites you to sit around it. 

			From deep inside the cave, three young ''hunters'', like the ones you saw on the walls before, appear.

			They are here to thank the Great Mother for the successful hunting and turn to you.

			[[Listen to the Hunters]]

			<<audio objectplacingsound stop>>
			<<audio firewalkingsound play>>
		


:: End of the Story {"position":"1375,175","size":"100,100"}

			Hi! @@.orange;We are Team Rewind!@@ Thank you for discovering the ''Deer Cave'' with us!
			Did you like it? Please light the flames below and leave a comment if you want, so we can develop this project better in the future!
			<div>
            	<img class="story-img" src="assets/img/Feedback.png">
            </div>
			Don't forget to tell your ''Dear Friends'' about it! And keep discovering the world!
			Team Rewind will head for the next discovery too! 
			See you there!

			<a href="index.html#home" target="_blank">End the Experience</a> 
			[[Restart]]

			<<audio mainsound stop>>
			<<audio teamrewindsound play>>
		


:: Get Closer {"position":"1325,400","size":"100,100"}

			While getting closer to the fire pit, you notice the dancing pictogram is missing and the person is right in front of it.
			<div>
            	<img class="story-img" src="Canva\Shaman _ _Get Closer.png">
            </div>
			@@.orange;Speleologist 4@@ reacts:
			<i>« FIRST REACTION: SHOCK! »</i>

			@@.orange;You:@@
			<i>« Don't tell me... That's actually.... The Shaman?! »</i>

			@@.orange;The person@@ stops what he was doing and starts talking to you and your colleagues:

			<i>« Dear Outsiders, you have entered the womb of the earth because I have summoned you across distant ages. The Great Mother, she who gives life and takes it back, has heard my prayer: she has allowed you to reach this ancient sanctuary, a crossroads for different peoples of the Mediterranean.

			I am the ''Shaman'' who watches over these paintings, guardian of our rites and our prayers.

			Now that you are here, into the heart of the earth, listen to what my people have left in these signs: the past wishes to speak…

			From these galleries unfold our ancient steps…

			Every corridor holds a fragment of our life: the hunting expeditions, the initiation rites of the young symbolized by the hands imprinted on the rock, and the spirit of our communities, always eager to give thanks and ask for protection from the Great Mother.

			Here, in the shadows and in the silence, every sign is a tale, every figure a bond between the visible world and that of the spirits.
			And now I will show you what… What… »</i>

			The Shaman stops.

			His gaze grows uncertain, as if, suddenly, a mysterious force had clouded his mind.
			<i>« I… I don’t remember… How does my sentence continue? »</i>

			The walls flicker in the firelight.

			The Shaman is having a hard time speaking. It feels like there is a force stopping him from telling his story.

			[[Help the Shaman]]

			<<audio dancingshamansound stop>>
			<<audio mainsound stop>>
			
			<<audio firewalkingsound play>>
		


:: Go on {"position":"275,200","size":"100,100"}

			You hear water dripping somewhere and regain your consciousness inside a humid and pitch black place.

			@@.orange;You@@ can't see anything and worriedly ask for your colleagues:
			<i>« Guys are you here? Are you okay? »</i>

			@@.orange;Speleologist 1:@@
			<i>« Yeah... I think I'm okay even though my body is aching all over! »</i>

			@@.orange;Speleologist 2:@@
			<i>« Still alive here too! »</i>

			@@.orange;Speleologist 3:@@
			<i>« Yeah, I'm okay but what was that? »</i>

			@@.orange;Speleologist 4:@@
			<i>« I would feel better after finding my flashlight! »</i>

			@@.orange;You:@@
			<i>« Wait, I had mine in my hands before... Where did it go? Ah, found it! »</i>

			[[Switch on your flashlight]]

			<<audio watersound play>>
		


:: Help the Shaman {"position":"850,400","size":"100,100"}

			For some reason the @@.orange;Shaman@@ doesn't seem to remember the words to his story.

			<i>« I... I don't remember... How does my sentence continue? »</i>
			<div>
            	<img class="story-img" src="Canva\1) dialogue choice _ _Help the Shaman.png">
            </div>
			Help him by choosing the correct option:

			<i>« … Becomes a high-quality cultural asset — ideal for enhancing the region and promoting sustainable tourism. Would you like my answer to be more detailed, more concise, or more relevant to your visit to the site? »</i>
			[[Choose text 1]]

			<i>« … Unites us to our origin, for every painting and every object here tells who we were, how we lived, and what sacred bonds connected us to the Great Mother. »</i>
			[[Choose text 2]]

			<<audio firewalkingsound stop>>
			<<audio mainsound play>>
		


