:: Keep Listening {"position":"625,450","size":"100,100"}

			The @@.orange;Shaman@@ says:
			<i>« Once you have reached this place, it is customary to make offerings to ingratiate yourselves with divine favors. </i>

			<i>You also have to do the same if you want to stay here and uncover our story. 
			I know this is what you most deem valuable as speleologists, right? »</i>

			@@.orange;Speleologist 4@@ whispers to You:
			<i>« I guess he really is a Shaman, huh... We didn't even have a chance to introduce ourselves yet and he already knows who we are and our profession. »</i>

			The @@.orange;Shaman@@ continues:
			<i>« Each of you have to make an offering. Since I brought you here, the object that you will offer is near you. Search for it. »</i>

			[[Look Around]]
			[[Ask for Hints]]

			<<audio mainsound stop>>

			<<audio wrongsound stop>>
			<<audio rightsound stop>>

			<<audio mainsound play>>
		


:: Listen to the Hunters {"position":"975,750","size":"100,100"}

			The hunters start talking to you.

			@@.orange;Hunter 1:@@ 
			<i>« Greetings, Outsiders. We are here to pay tribute to the Goddess for our last hunt. It has been a long day, one that began when the sun was still low on the horizon. We followed the tracks carefully, crossing through the forest and then the clearing that leads toward the river. »</i>

			@@.orange;Hunter 2:@@
			<i>« The ground was damp, the footprints were fresh. We knew we were close. We moved each step in silence, as we were taught, listening to every breath of the earth… and every whisper of the wind through the leaves. »</i>

			@@.orange;Hunter 3:@@
			<i>« At one point, we saw the animal silhouetted against the morning light… It was…  »</i>

			He stops and looks at the others, hesitant.

			@@.orange;Hunter 1:@@
			<i>« Yes… it was… »</i>

			@@.orange;Hunter 2:@@ 
			<i>« I can’t clearly remember anymore…  »</i>

			@@.orange;Hunter 3:@@
			<i>« Let’s look at the paintings. The truth is there.  »</i>

			The hunters and the speleologists approach the pictograms.

			@@.orange;Hunter 1:@@
			<i>« These images are not as we saw them last time.  »</i>

			@@.orange;Hunter 3:@@
			<i>« Or perhaps… It is we who no longer remember?  »</i>

			They turn to the speleologists, with seriousness and an almost ritual tone.

			@@.orange;Hunter 1:@@
			<i>« Stranger, you have new eyes. Perhaps you can see what we can no longer distinguish. Help us rediscover the truth of our hunt.  »</i>
			<div>
            	<img class="story-img" src="Canva\3) AI quiz game _ _Listen To The Hunters 1.png">
            </div>
			The paintings on the walls have changed. The @@.orange;Shaman@@ smirks and says:
			<i>« The hunters don't seem to recognize which animal they were hunting... »</i>

			Recall the wall paintings you have seen in the beginning and help them recognize the correct animal.
			<div>
            	<img class="story-img" src="Canva\3) AI quiz game _ _Listen To The Hunters 2.png">
            </div>
			What were they hunting? Choose a pictogram:

			[[1]]   [[2]]   [[3]]   [[4]]

			<<audio firewalkingsound stop>>
			<<audio mainsound play>>
		


