:: Speak to the Shaman {"position":"350,800","size":"100,100"}

			@@.orange;You:@@
			<i>« We have found the offerings. Here. »</i>

			The @@.orange;Shaman@@ replies:
			<i>« You have indeed. But you should not give them to me.

			Look closely around the fire pit. You will find pits of the same number as the offerings. Put your findings in the pits, but be careful: each offering has it's own pit. »</i>

			[[Place the Items]]

			<<audio writingsound stop>>
			<<audio mainsound play>>
		


:: Start Walking {"position":"725,250","size":"100,100"}

			While walking you start speculating on the meanings of the drawings and what they are actually portraying.
			<div>
            	<img class="story-img" src="Canva\Start Walking 1.png">
            </div>
			@@.orange;Speleologist 1:@@
			<i>« Hey, I think I see some drawings of people here... It seems like they have a bow in their hands so maybe they are hunting? »</i>

			@@.orange;Speleologist 2:@@
			<i>« I think you are right!! Don't these look like animals running from them?! »</i>
			<div>
            	<img class="story-img" src="Canva\Start Walking 2.png">
            </div>
			@@.orange;Speleologist 3:@@
			<i>« Guys, I see some handprints on this wall! »</i>

			@@.orange;Speleologist 4:@@
			<i>« Wow there are soo many. It feels like someone would suddenly show up out of nowhere! »</i>

			While your colleagues make guesses about the drawings, @@.orange;you@@ walk a bit further in and call the others:
			<i>« Hey guys, there are more!! There is a really peculiar one here! »</i>
			<div>
            	<img class="story-img" src="Canva\Start Walking 3.png">
            </div>
			@@.orange;Speleologist 1:@@
			<i>« It looks like a monkey! »</i>

			@@.orange;Speleologist 2:@@
			<i>« Isn't that... Just a dancing person? »</i>

			@@.orange;Speleologist 3:@@
			<i>« Well, there are other drawings over there! Let's take a look! »</i>

			@@.orange;You@@ whisper to yourself:
			<i>« A dancing person, huh?... Could it be a dancing <b>Shaman</b> maybe? It is pretty common to find paintings depicting a Shaman inside caves, since they were important figures for ancient communities because of their role as ritual leaders. That would also explain the... »</i>

			You get interrupted by @@.orange;Speleologist 4:@@
			<i>« Hey! What are you still doing there, all alone?! Come here or you're gonna get lost! »</i>

			You turn around and catch up to your colleagues.

			[[Keep Exploring]]

			
			<<audio flashlightsound stop>>
			<<audio walkingsound play>>
		


