:: Switch on your flashlight {"position":"500,275","size":"100,100"}

			<div>
            	<img class="story-img" src="assets\img\hero-bg.png">
            </div>

			You and your colleagues stand up and find yourselves in front of some walls with paintings on them and quickly figure out that you landed in an underground cave. 

			On the walls, there are geometrical shapes alongside figures that seem to portray humans and animals.

			As excited speleologists, you start diving deeper into the cave.

			[[Start Walking]]

			
            <<audio flashlightsound play>>
		
